  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Controls

    - WASD (Move camera)

    - Mouse (UI and unit actions)

    -
    LMB (Select)

    - RMB (Action)


    Units

    - Worker (can mine, build,
    attack and

    - Knight


    Structures

    - Castle

    - Barracks


    Resources

    -
    Gold


    How to play:

    - Use [worker]s to mine, they will retrieve the
    [gold] to the nearest [castle].

    - Spend [gold] to tell your [worker]s to
    build more [barracks] or [castle]s.

    - Use [gold] to train [worker]s at the
    [castle] or train [knight]s at the [barracks].


    How to win:

    - Destroy
    every enemy structure.


    GLHF'
